    "note": "These keys are the single source of truth for arc display names. The build step reads these into index.json arcMeta, replacing arcs-v2.json parent.title as the display authority once translations are needed.",
    "valueShape": "Each key maps to an element object. 'strings' holds translations; future namespaces extend the same object."
